display, exhibit, share, or otherwise distribute the content of the CN Portal it is for non-commercial purposes only. You must, however, explicitly acknowledge CN as the provider of such content on any such downloading, copying, display, exhibition, sharing or distribution thereof . CN reserves the right to require you to delete, destroy or otherwise remove any content that is used in a manner that in CN's opinion is contrary to this agreement. You agree that any person to whom you supply the content, directly or indirectly, will be advised of the terms of this Agreement, and that each such person is bound by these terms. You may in no way modify, reformulate, adapt, alter, adjust, change, disassemble, frame or decrypt any of the content of the CN Portal. 5. PRICES AND PRICE DOCUMENTS By using this website, the user agrees to the following: The tariffs and confidential private agreement documents accessed through CN's website are an electronic version of an original document. This electronic version is provided to the user for his convenience. In case of a conflict between the electronic version and the original version, the original version produced by CN will prevail. The electronic version of contracts is provided for the user's convenience. The contract itself is valid only if it has been duly executed or electronically approved by all parties to it. Access to confidential private agreements is provided to the user as a representative of a CN Customer or CN Business Partner. Each Customer or Business Partner agrees to safeguard all information relating to the security procedures for access to confidential private agreements, including, without limitation, personal identification numbers, codes and passwords used. Each Customer or Business Partner agrees that such information will not be disclosed to anyone other than employees who need to have such information, and each Customer or Business Partner agrees to establish appropriate internal policies to ensure such