sp; REGARDLESS OF WHETHER NEGLIGENCE OF CN, ITS SUBSIDIARIES, AFFILIATES, CONTRACTORS, AGENTS, OFFICERS, DIRECTORS AND/OR EMPLOYEES, MAY HAVE CAUSED OR CONTRIBUTED THERETO . You shall be responsible to the full extent of any liability, payment or other agreement made by CN, its subsidiaries, affiliates, contractors, agents, officers, directors and/or employees, in settlement and/or satisfaction of any claim or potential claim, whether such payment or agreement is made or concluded prior to or following the institution of formal proceedings against CN, its subsidiaries, affiliates, contractors, agents, officers, directors and/or employees. 8. LINKS TO OTHER SITES The CN Web site contains links to facilitate your access to third party sites. CN does not control any third party site and is not responsible for the contents of any linked site or any link contained in a linked site. CN is providing such link to you only as a convenience and the inclusion of any link does not imply endorsement, investigation or verification by CN of the linked site or information contained therein. 9. INTERNET E-MAIL The Internet is not yet a fully secure medium, and therefore confidentiality and privacy of the information transmitted thereon cannot be ensured. CN will not be liable for any damages resulting from the transmission of confidential or personal information. 10. IMAGES Images of people or places displayed on CN's Web site are either the property of, or used with permission by, CN. The use of these images by you, or anyone else authorized by you, is prohibited unless specifically permitted by these terms and conditions or specific permission is provided elsewhere on the site. Any unauthorized use of the images may violate copyright laws, trademark laws, the laws of privacy and publicity or other applicable laws. 11. USE OF INFORMATION Should any viewer of the CN Portal respond with information including feedback data, such as questions, comments, suggestions, or the like regardi